    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk \"liberating\" doesn't feel like the right word for it. it feels heavy. like, if nothing matters, then why bother with the effort of it all? the eating, the working, the feeling things... why even put in the energy to just exist if the end result is always just returning to that nothingness? it feels like we're just fighting an impossible battle against entropy for no reason.",
